## Testing

- `test/TestGunRange.tscn` — headless TTK sweep, every gun × 3 distances, plus an
  AABB dump. Run: `--headless --fixed-fps 600 --quit-after 20000`.
- `test/TestGunOrient.tscn` — orientation check-sheet, asserts every gun's barrel
  points downrange.
- `test/TestRocketFlight.tscn` — films a rocket side-on down a 40 m range to judge
  whether the projectile is trackable in the air.
- The training setup screen has a **Weapon** picker (Random, or any of the seven
  guns including the arena ones), so "pick a gun, shoot a dummy, count shots" is
  the whole manual loop and arena weapons can be practised without winning a race.

Every tuning number is `[Export]`ed, so damage / fire rate / spread can be edited
in the remote inspector mid-match without a rebuild.

## Out of scope / still open

- `EnemyController` stays melee-only, by decision. Its parry-timing read was
  repointed at the player's **reload** window (the closest analogue to the sword's
  punishable recovery), so bots press you while you reload.
- Upper-body aim blend while sprinting.
- `UAL1_FpArms.glb` was never exported, so there are still no FP arms — only a
  floating weapon. Guns do not regress this; the code path is ready if wanted.
- Trinkets / chests.
- **Pre-existing, unrelated:** `test/TestPieceCategories.cs` is untracked scratch
